 "section_summary": "This section contains transcripts of Japanese radio station JZK broadcasts from May and June 1941, together with a Federal Bureau of Investigation letter forwarding several of the May transcripts to the State Department. The broadcasts combine war reports, Japanese domestic news, and commentary promoting Japan’s policy in China and portraying Britain and the United States as threats. The section begins and ends in the middle of broadcast transcripts.",
